  "carryover_diagnostic": {
    "correct_identity": "Average annual ASP = total CPU sales / total CPU units. Q3/Q4 exit carryover must compare an exit ASP with the unit-weighted 2026 average, not average the reported YoY growth percentages. The same-SKU price, shipped-core mix and customer discount mix cannot be separated from public blended ASP.",
    "proper_warning": "The exact-rounded central equations imply equal2025Q1/Q2 units and2025Q3 units two-thirds ofQ1; that is not an observed shipment table. Small rounding changes strongly change the inference. Q4 has no actual disclosed outcome at the cutoff.",
    "relaxed_unit_only_feasibility_check": {
      "assumption": "Each reported whole-percent unit change is rounded within0.5 percentage point; positive quarterly units; normalize total2026Q1\u2013Q3 units to1. Impose Q1\u22125,Q2+9,Q3+10,H1+2,YTD+4 ranges. This intentionally omits further ASP constraints, so it is a relaxed bound, not a full identified range.",
      "Q3_share_of_YTD_units_min": 0.13345410628019527,
